7. As no further development is on record, the writ petition is disposed of with the following observations:
(i) if the petitioners have received the award with/without protest, the remedy lies before appropriate authority for enhancement of compensation;
(ii) if pursuant to the said notice, they have not forwarded their claim, are required to submit their individual document to satisfy the Patna High Court CWJC No.24683 of 2018(2) dt.03-02-2026 authority both on the bonafide of their claim as also the upgradation of category.

